flowchart LR
  C[年龄/性别/生活方式/既往血管病与卒中] --> H[基线Hcy]
  C --> W[背景WMH]
  C --> Y[复发或功能结局]
  B[B12/叶酸状态] --> H
  B --> W
  B --> Y
  K[肾功能背景] --> H
  K --> W
  K --> Y
  K --> Q[CYSC：肾功能代理]
  H --> Y
  W --> Y
  L[长期Hcy相关代谢背景] --> H
  L --> W
  L --> A[本次卒中负担/急性状态]
  A --> H
  W --> A
  A --> Y
  P[卒中前mRS] --> Y
%% Working causal assumptions for adjustment. Arrows are not fitted results.
%% H1/H2: background + measurement terms. H4: additionally condition on A and P.
%% Hcy x WMH is a model term, not an extra biological node.
